# Keep Vercel CLI uploads scoped to the linked mingla-business project.
# The repo contains native builds and node_modules that exceed Vercel's
# request body limit when deploying from the monorepo root.

*

!mingla-business/
!mingla-business/**

mingla-business/.env
mingla-business/.expo/
mingla-business/android/
mingla-business/dist/
mingla-business/ios/
mingla-business/node_modules/
